{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51685","headline":"追鲍约（侍郎鲍约，颇从臾忠懿王纳土。及王归宋，约窜处海上，王以诗追之曰〖见下〗。迄今有遐追庙焉。） · 钱弘俶","name":"追鲍约（侍郎鲍约，颇从臾忠懿王纳土。及王归宋，约窜处海上，王以诗追之曰〖见下〗。迄今有遐追庙焉。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东遐追兮西遐追，鲍约何如罢钓归。\n（《五代诗话》六引《十国春秋》）（〖1〗见《十国春秋》卷八七《崔仁冀传》附。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}